{"method": "thread/list", "response": {"id": 2, "result": {"data": [{"id": "01a12185-2353-7051-9398-8d0e87774bd2", "extra": null, "sessionId": "01a12185-2353-7051-9398-8d0e87774bd2", "forkedFromId": null, "parentThreadId": null, "preview": "Reply with exactly: PROBE-OK", "ephemeral": false, "section": null, "sectionEnteredAt": null, "projectId": null, "historyMode": "legacy", "modelProvider": "openai", "createdAt": 1791563735, "updatedAt": 1791563768, "recencyAt": 1791563763, "status": {"type": "notLoaded"}, "path": "\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\10\\10\\rollout-2026-10-10T00-35-35-01a12185-2353-7051-9398-8d0e87774bd2.jsonl", "cwd": "D:\\claude\\codex-relay\\evidence\\m1", "cliVersion": "0.149.0", "source": "vscode", "canAcceptDirectInput": null, "threadSource": null, "agentNickname": null, "agentRole": null, "gitInfo": null, "name": null, "turns": []}, {"id": "01a12156-89b7-7282-a869-f3b1402ad97e", "extra": null, "sessionId": "01a12156-89b7-7282-a869-f3b1402ad97e", "forkedFromId": null, "parentThreadId": null, "preview": "当前codex是可以在本机codex的多个对话之间实现互相对话，那是否意味着我可以部署一个railway后端服务，来实现跨设备的不同codex的对话；", "ephemeral": false, "section": null, "sectionEnteredAt": null, "projectId": null, "historyMode": "paginated", "modelProvider": "openai", "createdAt": 1791560681, "updatedAt": 1791561585, "recencyAt": 1791561080, "status": {"type": "notLoaded"}, "path": "C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\10\\09\\rollout-2026-10-09T23-44-41-01a12156-89b7-7282-a869-f3b1402ad97e.jsonl", "cwd": "C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-10-09\\new-chat", "cliVersion": "0.153.4", "source": "vscode", "canAcceptDirectInput": null, "threadSource": null, "agentNickname": null, "agentRole": null, "gitInfo": null, "name": "评估 Railway 跨设备 Codex 对话", "turns": []}, {"id": "01a11ac2-c60a-76b3-b706-3a7899eb1ed4", "extra": null, "sessionId": "01a11ac2-c60a-76b3-b706-3a7899eb1ed4", "forkedFromId": null, "parentThreadId": null, "preview": "帮我把当前在railway上部署的那个megwin-workbench项目定位到它在哪个Git仓库？它跟当前的ai-bad仓库是什么关系？它跟当前的Harness仓库的哪一些技能有关联？\n\n\n\n这是第一层基线，作为我新项目Megwin仓库的一个基础。这个仓库的定位是作为整个 AI Lab 项目团队，或者说Megvii项目团队，进行后续项目规划和项目管理的一个对外看板和对内看板：\n\n1. 对外的部分：主要做到精简信息\n2. 对内的部分：主要做到与XP机器人协同管理\n\n\n\n整体的系统路由是：\n\n1. 这个workbench对外，同时对业务人员，再对产品人员\n2. 再往下一层是内部的Meego平台\n\n  a. Meego平台是技术这一侧，用于进行技术工单流转的，它是技术内部沟通的一个渠道\n\n  b. 产品在明确好对应的需求后，连同产品文档一起提交Meego工单，交由技术处理\n\n  c. 所有的Meego这边的状态包括了：待需求评审、工单开始、需求评审、技术评审、开始开发、开始测试、技术验收、产品验收、最终上线等等。这一系列的状态流转，你需要去Meego上面去获取对应的枚举值\n\n  d. Meego的单子的创建，有Story和缺陷两种，你也要明确清楚，找对应的专家和PSS建立出来\n\n\n\n这个workbench目前的开发状态，你需要开新对话去明确清楚它的切面是什么样的，然后先把整体的架构重新梳理一下，从各个的信源获取对应的信息。\n\n\n\n像Meego同步这些事情，在railway上面好像经常跑出错，你得看一下具体问题所在。Meego的同步分为两个鉴权：\n\n1. Meego机器人鉴权\n2. Meego MCP 鉴权\n\n\n\n它们两个所带有的能力和凭证都不一样，并且当前Meego有墨西哥空间和巴西空间，我们目前主用的是墨西哥空间，但后续巴西项目起来了，我们也会考虑巴西项目，所以这里要留口\n\n\n\n[$staff-task-experts](C:\\Users\\Administrator\\\\.agents\\skills\\staff-task-experts\\SKILL.md)", "ephemeral": false, "section": {"id": "01984de2-8f74-7c91-a3b2-5c5e937cf318", "name": "Pinned", "appearance": null}, "sectionEnteredAt": 1791450661, "projectId": null, "historyMode": "paginated", "modelProvider": "openai", "createdAt": 1791450334, "updatedAt": 1791543448, "recencyAt": 1791543433, "status": {"type": "notLoaded"}, "path": "\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\10\\08\\rollout-2026-10-08T17-05-34-01a11ac2-c60a-76b3-b706-3a7899eb1ed4.jsonl", "cwd": "D:\\claude\\aibet-backend-handover\\tmp\\codex\\WI-20260824-workbench-requirement-cards", "cliVersion": "0.153.4", "source": "vscode", "canAcceptDirectInput": null, "threadSource": null, "agentNickname": null, "agentRole": null, "gitInfo": null, "name": "定位 Megwin Workbench 仓库关系", "turns": []}, {"id": "01a11ab7-aab0-7830-8240-06cbe4e217dc", "extra": null, "sessionId": "01a11ab7-aab0-7830-8240-06cbe4e217dc", "forkedFromId": null, "parentThreadId": null, "preview": "看下当前的C盘空间为什么突然占用空间这么大，解决问题，把你codex产生的垃圾都删除", "ephemeral": false, "section": {"id": "01984de2-8f74-7c91-a3b2-5c5e937cf318"